---
export const prerender = true;
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Beautychain Limited / MLM Lip"
  description="Terms governing B2B inquiries, quotations, sampling and private label manufacturing orders with Beautychain Limited (MLM Lip brand)."
>
  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Terms of Service' }]} />
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="note">Last updated: 22 November 2026 · Legal entity: {site.legalName} (operating the MLM Lip brand)</p>
      <p class="lead" style="max-width:680px">
        These terms govern your use of mlmlip.com and the business relationship between you and
        <strong>{site.legalName}</strong> (the "Manufacturer", operating the MLM Lip brand), from
        inquiry through quotation, sampling and order fulfillment. This site serves business
        customers (B2B) only.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tint" style="padding-top:32px">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid two" style="align-items: start">

        <div class="card">
          <h2>1. Nature of inquiries &amp; quotations</h2>
          <p style="margin:0">
            Information on this site — including product specifications, formulations, lead times
            and pricing references — is provided for business discussion and does not constitute a
            binding offer. A quotation issued by our sales team is an invitation to negotiate; a
            manufacturing contract is formed only upon our written order confirmation and receipt
            of the agreed deposit. Sample photos and shade references are indicative; natural
            batch variation within agreed colorimetric tolerances (ΔE &lt; 0.8) is normal.
          </p>
          <h2 style="margin-top:28px">2. Quotation validity</h2>
          <p style="margin:0">
            Quotations are valid for <strong>30 days</strong> from the date of issue unless stated
            otherwise, reflecting component and ingredient market prices. Minimum order quantity:
            <strong>100 pcs per SKU (flexible 100-200 pcs)</strong> across all lip categories, unless individually agreed.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h2>3. Sampling &amp; order terms (summary)</h2>
          <p style="margin:0">
            Custom lab samples are produced within <strong>7 business days</strong> after brief
            sign-off; 100% of sampling fees are credited back against your bulk order invoice. Bulk
            production runs 15–25 business days after artwork and sample approval, plus transit.
            Specific payment schedule, deposit, tooling (mold) ownership and shipment terms are
            governed by the proforma invoice and order confirmation for each project — those
            documents prevail over this summary. Tooling paid by you remains your property and is
            never used for other clients.
          </p>
          <h2 style="margin-top:28px">4. Compliance &amp; regulatory responsibility</h2>
          <p style="margin:0">
            We manufacture under GMPC and ISO 22716 standards and provide supporting documentation
            (batch CoA, US FDA MoCRA-aligned facility registration, EU CPNP dossier assistance).
            For regulated markets, the importer/distributor or the designated Responsible Person
            (EU) holds final market-compliance responsibility, except where explicitly assumed by
            us in the order confirmation.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h2>5. Intellectual property</h2>
          <p style="margin:0">
            Site content, imagery, formulation library data and brand assets are owned by
            {site.legalName} and may not be reproduced commercially. Your brand assets
            (logos, artwork, formulations you supply) remain your property; we use them solely to
            fulfill your order and treat them as confidential. Confidential information exchanged
            during a project is protected by mutual NDA upon request.
          </p>
          <h2 style="margin-top:28px">6. Liability</h2>
          <p style="margin:0">
            Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot be limited by law. Otherwise our
            aggregate liability under a project is limited to the invoiced value of the affected
            order. We are not liable for indirect or consequential losses. Claims for visible
            defects must be raised within 14 days of delivery.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h2>7. Governing law &amp; disputes</h2>
          <p style="margin:0">
            These terms are governed by the laws of the jurisdiction of {site.legalName}'s
            incorporation and, where a buyer's mandatory consumer/customer protections apply in the
            buyer's own country of establishment, those mandatory local protections are unaffected.
            The parties shall first attempt amicable settlement for 30 days before commencing
            proceedings, which shall be brought before the courts having jurisdiction under
            applicable conflict-of-law rules.
          </p>
          <h2 style="margin-top:28px">8. Contact</h2>
          <p style="margin:0">
            Any contractual communication: <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a>
            or WhatsApp <a href={site.contact.whatsappLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{site.contact.whatsapp}</a>.
            See also our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> and
            <a href="/cookie-policy/">Cookie Policy</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
